674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4o1MNUZd0zQQ7kNvwG06tgC&_nc_oc=Adr6NLK72sFwvBfKNvPh4ZNz2VKXjo7F0ZwZUJ4p8RGsZ2IUs-cG1kFDdg-CTjDSCws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLn5JZ-7XDYbmB61Rr8peooJHqqgbJ0KT3exJlbtcCAzQ&oe=6AB29159"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hooLkp9CCcwQ7kNvwHS1yBD&_nc_oc=AdraSPFf1NdDq7b0iZtrC0WOXJy5iSjq84vfvtdOGYquo1A9T4HGdLz_5w3Cv7hJKVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ9A-q2xbr7keMzklyODhJhI7Ly4CIT2QpVzZo26CD6GQ&oe=6AB29A16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MY-DRjH_UAQ7kNvwGrCqUr&_nc_oc=AdrTQo_BvT3m0Me2FRrYi85yIxnQX0UiwdtNtOX2SOQ0xFnS5MnQbsyMOrwnm7RSJ5E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIZgXkZuthEV_6UOqkj-zUYVsxEyQSHL_tpM-SuYrKAfQ&oe=6AB29631"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip